{"id":8402,"bangumiId":8402,"type":2,"name":"Panty & Stocking with Garterbelt","name_cn":"吊带袜天使","date":"2010-10-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/a7/49/8402_Q9mLv.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/a7/49/8402_Q9mLv.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/a7/49/8402_Q9mLv.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/a7/49/8402_Q9mLv.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/a7/49/8402_Q9mLv.jpg"},"summary":"在天堂和地狱的裂缝之间有一座城市—堕天城（Daten City），在那里人们一直饱受“恶灵（Ghost）”的袭击。\r\n腐蚀人心的黑暗，至今仍在悄悄地侵蚀这个城市，有人正试图以超自然力，消灭这些由欲望产生的恶灵，担负了这驱逐黑暗的使命。\r\n因行为不检而被踢出天堂的天使姐妹——Panty与Stocking，必须在Garterbelt的指示下歼灭恶灵，并得到代表功绩的天堂金币（Heaven Coins）作为回报，达成目标即可回到天堂。\r\n然而天使姐妹对在堕天使城的日常生活，显然有相当程度的病态兴趣……","rating":{"rank":263,"total":14392,"count":{"1":27,"2":13,"3":22,"4":64,"5":187,"6":801,"7":2932,"8":6206,"9":3085,"10":1055},"score":8},"collection":{"on_hold":1889,"dropped":667,"wish":7947,"collect":22588,"doing":4128},"tags":[{"name":"GAINAX","count":3572,"total_count":40936},{"name":"今石洋之","count":3126,"total_count":24841},{"name":"美式","count":2347,"total_count":2576},{"name":"原创","count":2179,"total_count":635575},{"name":"重口","count":1969,"total_count":10099},{"name":"恶搞","count":1740,"total_count":9639},{"name":"TV","count":1651,"total_count":1443510},{"name":"下限","count":1472,"total_count":5107},{"name":"2010年10月","count":1402,"total_count":13243},{"name":"2010","count":913,"total_count":44318},{"name":"搞笑","count":859,"total_count":656832},{"name":"战斗","count":749,"total_count":489005},{"name":"飞天小女警×光之美少女","count":424,"total_count":425},{"name":"日本","count":346,"total_count":313479},{"name":"Stocking！","count":304,"total_count":304},{"name":"成年小女警","count":257,"total_count":257}],"eps":13,"total_episodes":13,"aliases":["吊带袜天使","Panty & Stocking with Garterbelt","小裤裤、长筒袜、吊袜带、psg","Panty＆Stocking with Garterbelt","パンティ&ストッキングwithガーターベルト"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"annualRank"